From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dariusz Majnert <dariusz.majnert@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 22 Sep 2026 21:15:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] hal: expose native thread period statistics

Ported to the getter/setter HAL API of v2.10.0-pre2. The statistics are
now sint parameters (64-bit, printed in decimal by halcmd) instead of u32
and s64 ones, and stats-reset is a bool parameter. The measurement keeps
its values in the thread structure and publishes them to the parameters
once per cycle.
